        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e93809c4a8364aad96edfe7185ed6b9b",
      "statement": "When 'Summarize lesson' is invoked on a Lesson Note that the learner has manually edited (`edited_since_generated = true`), the API asks for confirmation before overwriting (PRD D8). The confirmation check happens in `apps/api` before the agent is called.",
