      "id": "claim_b1fc458be93f4128a9499ec74bf94168",
      "statement": "The 'Discuss this note' flow is orchestrated in `apps/api`: it reads the Lesson Note via `learning.application`, then starts a new thread via `tutoring.application`, passing the note as context and recording `source_note_id`. This keeps `tutoring` free of any import from `learning`, satisfying the acyclic module dependency rule.",
